{"verse":20,"translation":"And the servants of Absalom came to the woman, to the house, and said, “Where are Ahimaaz and Jonathan?” And the woman said to them, “They have crossed over the channel of the water.” And they searched and did not find, and returned to Jerusalem.","tokens":[{"surface":"ויבאו","gloss":"And came"},{"surface":"עבדי","gloss":"the servants of"},{"surface":"אבשלום","gloss":"Absalom"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"to"},{"surface":"האשה","gloss":"the woman"},{"surface":"הביתה","gloss":"to the house"},{"surface":"ויאמרו","gloss":"and said"},{"surface":"איה","gloss":"Where"},{"surface":"אחימעץ","gloss":"Ahimaaz"},{"surface":"ויהונתן","gloss":"and Jonathan"},{"surface":"ותאמר","gloss":"and said"},{"surface":"להם","gloss":"to them"},{"surface":"האשה","gloss":"the woman"},{"surface":"עברו","gloss":"they have crossed over"},{"surface":"מיכל","gloss":"the channel of"},{"surface":"המים","gloss":"the water"},{"surface":"ויבקשו","gloss":"and they searched"},{"surface":"ולא","gloss":"and not"},{"surface":"מצאו","gloss":"found"},{"surface":"וישבו","gloss":"and returned"},{"surface":"ירושלם","gloss":"to Jerusalem"}],"pass":"en5","judge":"glm-5.3"}